#. ja: どうする？
#. de: Was möchtest du tun?
#. fr: Que voulez-vous faire<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMjiConstructResidence_00783:TEXT_CTSMJICONSTRUCTRESIDENCE_00783_SYSTEM_000_000:1"
msgid "What will you do?"
msgstr "Что будете делать?"

#. ja: アイランドホールの建築
#. de: Eine Strandhütte bauen
#. fr: Construire la hutte placide
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMjiConstructResidence_00783:TEXT_CTSMJICONSTRUCTRESIDENCE_00783_Q1_000_001:1"
msgid "Construct the cozy cabin."
msgstr "Построить уютный домик."

#. ja: キャンセル
#. de: Abbrechen
#. fr: Rien
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMjiConstructResidence_00783:TEXT_CTSMJICONSTRUCTRESIDENCE_00783_Q1_000_010:1"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr "Ничего."

#. ja: どうする？
#. de: Was möchtest du tun?
#. fr: Que voulez-vous faire<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMjiConstructResidence_00783:TEXT_CTSMJICONSTRUCTRESIDENCE_00783_SYSTEM_000_100:1"
msgid "What will you do?"
msgstr "Что будете делать?"

#. ja: アイランドホールの改築
#. de: Die Strandhütte umbauen
#. fr: Rénover la hutte placide
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMjiConstructResidence_00783:TEXT_CTSMJICONSTRUCTRESIDENCE_00783_Q2_000_100:1"
msgid "Renovate the cozy cabin."
msgstr "Обновить уютный домик."

#. ja: アイランドホールの外観変更
#. de: Das Aussehen der Strandhütte ändern
#. fr: Modifier l'apparence de la hutte placide
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMjiConstructResidence_00783:TEXT_CTSMJICONSTRUCTRESIDENCE_00783_Q2_000_101:1"
msgid "Change the cozy cabin's appearance."
msgstr "Изменить внешний вид уютного домика."

#. ja: 開拓拠点の景観変更
#. de: Das Aussehen des Domizils ändern
#. fr: Modifier le paysage de la base
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMjiConstructResidence_00783:TEXT_CTSMJICONSTRUCTRESIDENCE_00783_Q2_000_102:1"
msgid "Change the hideaway's appearance."
msgstr "Изменить внешний вид убежища."

#. ja: キャンセル
#. de: Abbrechen
#. fr: Rien
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMjiConstructResidence_00783:TEXT_CTSMJICONSTRUCTRESIDENCE_00783_Q2_000_110:1"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr "Ничего."

#. ja: 開拓を進めて開拓ランクを上げることで、<br>アイランドホールを改築することができるようになります。
#. de: Du kannst deine Strandhütte weiter ausbauen, sobald du mehr Land erschlossen und eine höhere Inselstufe erreicht hast.
#. fr: Augmenter votre rang insulaire vous donnera accès aux rénovations.
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMjiConstructResidence_00783:TEXT_CTSMJICONSTRUCTRESIDENCE_00783_Q2_000_120:1"
msgid "In order to renovate the cozy cabin, you must continue to develop your island and increase your sanctuary rank."
msgstr "Чтобы обновить уютный домик, продолжайте развивать остров и повышать его ранг."

#. ja: アイランドホール管理用の看板のようだ。
#. de: Dies scheint die Leittafel für die Strandhütte zu sein.
#. fr: Ce panneau de con<shy>struc<shy>tion est destiné à la hutte placide.
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMjiConstructResidence_00783:TEXT_CTSMJICONSTRUCTRESIDENCE_00783_Q2_000_200:1"
msgid "This appears to be a log with a board attached to it. How quaint."
msgstr "Похоже, к бревну прикрепили доску. Как занятно."
